IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REDEFINES-DEMO.
       AUTHOR. VALIDATION-PLATFORM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RECORD.
           05  WS-NUMERIC      PIC 9(6) VALUE 123456.
           05  WS-REDEF        REDEFINES WS-NUMERIC.
               10  WS-PART1    PIC 9(3).
               10  WS-PART2    PIC 9(3).
           05  WS-CHAR         REDEFINES WS-NUMERIC PIC X(6).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "REDEFINES DEMO STARTED".
           DISPLAY "WS-NUMERIC=" WS-NUMERIC.
           DISPLAY "WS-PART1=" WS-PART1.
           DISPLAY "WS-PART2=" WS-PART2.
           DISPLAY "WS-CHAR=" WS-CHAR.

           MOVE "ABCDEF" TO WS-CHAR.
           DISPLAY "AFTER MOVE CHARS:".
           DISPLAY "WS-NUMERIC=" WS-NUMERIC.
           DISPLAY "WS-PART1=" WS-PART1.
           DISPLAY "WS-PART2=" WS-PART2.
           DISPLAY "WS-CHAR=" WS-CHAR.

           STOP RUN.